  restart file = 22 Jul 2025, LAMMPS = 22 Jul 2025
  restoring atom style atomic from restart
  triclinic box = (-0.052285581 -0.0467706 -0.051526285) to (71.702286 71.696771 71.701526) with tilt (0 0 0)
